{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MKBxe4Tkgm1WyD2Yv4LNHQ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the Diskless Core design discussion documentation, I found the answer:\\\\n\\\\n## Final Decision on RLMM\\\\n\\\\nThe final decision was that diskless topics would **NOT reuse the existing tiered-storage RLMM directly**, but instead **a separate KIP would be proposed for RLMM design optimization**.\\\\n\\\\nThis decision is documented in `/store/window-99-summary.md` (dated 2026-04-20). In a response on 2026-04-20T15:14:43Z, Viktor Somogyi-Vass addressed Jun Rao's detailed 7-point technical feedback on the Diskless Core KIP-1163, specifically noting:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"RLMM design optimization (separate KIP proposed)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThis indicates that rather than integrating diskless metadata management into the existing tiered-storage remote log metadata manager, the community decided to handle RLMM optimization as a separate, independent KIP to avoid conflating the two concerns.\\\\n\\\\n**File cited**: `/store/window-99-summary.md` (lines 325-336)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"kips-and-discussions.md\\\",\\\"mailing-list/window-119-kip-discussions.md\\\",\\\"mailing-list/window-116-kip-discussions.md\\\",\\\"window-120-summary.md\\\",\\\"window-99-summary.md\\\",\\\"window-103-summary.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":47.08,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":367812,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":31047,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1180982,\\\"input_tokens\\\":138,\\\"output_tokens\\\":3817}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c17a9964-593f-429d-a7b9-8501b281994c","uuid":"267c3647-b694-45d1-8081-0806df183c74","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:59:44.195Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the Diskless Core design discussion documentation, I found the answer:\\\\n\\\\n## Final Decision on RLMM\\\\n\\\\nThe final decision was that diskless topics would **NOT reuse the existing tiered-storage RLMM directly**, but instead **a separate KIP would be proposed for RLMM design optimization**.\\\\n\\\\nThis decision is documented in `/store/window-99-summary.md` (dated 2026-04-20). In a response on 2026-04-20T15:14:43Z, Viktor Somogyi-Vass addressed Jun Rao's detailed 7-point technical feedback on the Diskless Core KIP-1163, specifically noting:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"RLMM design optimization (separate KIP proposed)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThis indicates that rather than integrating diskless metadata management into the existing tiered-storage remote log metadata manager, the community decided to handle RLMM optimization as a separate, independent KIP to avoid conflating the two concerns.\\\\n\\\\n**File cited**: `/store/window-99-summary.md` (lines 325-336)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"kips-and-discussions.md\\\",\\\"mailing-list/window-119-kip-discussions.md\\\",\\\"mailing-list/window-116-kip-discussions.md\\\",\\\"window-120-summary.md\\\",\\\"window-99-summary.md\\\",\\\"window-103-summary.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":47.08,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":367812,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":31047,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1180982,\\\"input_tokens\\\":138,\\\"output_tokens\\\":3817}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on the Diskless Core design discussion documentation, I found the answer:\\n\\n## Final Decision on RLMM\\n\\nThe final decision was that diskless topics would **NOT reuse the existing tiered-storage RLMM directly**, but instead **a separate KIP would be proposed for RLMM design optimization**.\\n\\nThis decision is documented in `/store/window-99-summary.md` (dated 2026-04-20). In a response on 2026-04-20T15:14:43Z, Viktor Somogyi-Vass addressed Jun Rao's detailed 7-point technical feedback on the Diskless Core KIP-1163, specifically noting:\\n\\n> \\\"RLMM design optimization (separate KIP proposed)\\\"\\n\\nThis indicates that rather than integrating diskless metadata management into the existing tiered-storage remote log metadata manager, the community decided to handle RLMM optimization as a separate, independent KIP to avoid conflating the two concerns.\\n\\n**File cited**: `/store/window-99-summary.md` (lines 325-336)\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"kips-and-discussions.md\",\"mailing-list/window-119-kip-discussions.md\",\"mailing-list/window-116-kip-discussions.md\",\"window-120-summary.md\",\"window-99-summary.md\",\"window-103-summary.md\"],\"seconds\":47.08,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":2,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":367812,\"cache_write_tokens\":31047,\"cost_usd\":0.1180982,\"input_tokens\":138,\"output_tokens\":3817}}"}}}
